WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
ONE EVENT DOES NOT SHOW THE WHOLE RECORD. A fictional session can sit inside a longer modeled pathway without defining care.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
EXPAND THE FIXTURE. Connect declared purpose, permission, handoff, follow-up, evidence and recourse states.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
KEEP STATES DISTINCT. Unaccepted, withdrawn and overdue remain separate fictional states with no legal effect.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
A RECORD IS NOT A LIFELINE. The fixture does not monitor, diagnose, triage, treat or provide emergency response.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
MAKE THE FICTIONAL RULES VISIBLE. Owners and transitions belong to this model—not a clinical or legal standard.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
KEEP STATE AND LIMIT TOGETHER. A pathway record is legible when each declared rule and unknown remains visible.
